lex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3\">\n        <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dhmn00910&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex-1 text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-600 to-blue-600 hover:from-sky-500 hover:to-blue-500 text-white font-black py-3 px-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg transform active:scale-95 transition\">\n          FANZAで本編を見る・無料サンプル動画 ▶\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"/posts/hmn00910\" class=\"text-center bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition\">\n          詳細レビュー\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"my-10 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-2xl relative\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"bg-sky-600 text-white font-black text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-lg\">第5位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono tracking-wider\">品番: RPRJ00003</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-amber-400 font-black text-sm tracking-wide\">★★★★★ 4.8 / 5.0</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-white leading-snug mb-4 hover:text-sky-400 transition\">\n    <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Drprj00003&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">ドM崩壊エアライン学生 本堂彩海</a>\n  </h3>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\">\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-5\">\n      <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Drprj00003&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"block group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-700/80 shadow-lg relative\">\n        <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/rprj00003/rprj00003pl.jpg\" alt=\"ドM崩壊エアライン学生 本堂彩海\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-300 flex items-end p-4\">\n          <span class=\"bg-sky-600 text-white font-bold text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-lg\">FANZA公式で今すぐ無料サンプル再生 ▶</span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs bg-slate-800/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/50 text-slate-300\">\n        <span class=\"text-slate-400\">注目スコア：</span>\n        <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-300\">ドM開花度: 99% | 制服調教度: 98% | 実用性: 98%</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-4\">\n      <div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400\">\n        <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300\">出演キャスト：</strong> <a href=\"/actress/%E6%9C%AC%E5%A0%82%E5%BD%A9%E6%B5%B7\" class=\"text-rose-400 hover:text-rose-300 underline font-bold transition\">本堂彩海</a></div>\n        <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300\">収録ジャンル：</strong> <a href=\"/genre/haibijon\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">ハイビジョン</a> <a href=\"/genre/inran-haado-kei\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">淫乱・ハード系</a> <a href=\"/genre/tantai-sakuhin\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">単体作品</a> <a href=\"/genre/fera\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">フェラ</a> <a href=\"/genre/kyonyuu\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">巨乳</a> <a href=\"/genre/shiofuki\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">潮吹き</a></div>\n        <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300\">メーカー：</strong> 豊彦</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"text-slate-200 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-3 bg-slate-950/60 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80\">\n        <h4>【作品解説・見どころ】本堂彩海の清楚なエアライン学生がドM覚醒！徹底調教の記録</h4>\n<p>将来を嘱望された航空会社の訓練生・本堂彩海が、厳しい教官や男たちの要求に屈服し、内なるドMの雌へと開花していくドキュメンタリータッチの傑作。最初は規律正しい立ち振る舞いと清潔感あふれる笑顔を見せていた彼女が、執拗な身体検査と性感開発によって次第に快楽の奴隷へと堕ちていく心理描写が非常にリアルです。</p>\n<h4>【実用ポイント】規律と恥辱の狭間でイキ狂う哀愁とエロティシズム</h4>\n<p>制服を着たままで四つん這いにされ、お尻を突き出して後背位で奥まで抉られるシーンは必見。高貴なプライドが完全に粉砕され、涙と涎で顔をぐしゃぐしゃにしながら快楽を懇願する本堂彩海の体当たり演技は、見る者の男の本能を狂わせる凄まじい熱量を放っています。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      \n\n      <div class=\"pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3\">\n        <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Drprj00003&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex-1 text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-600 to-blue-600 hover:from-sky-500 hover:to-blue-500 text-white font-black py-3 px-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg transform active:scale-95 transition\">\n          FANZAで本編を見る・無料サンプル動画 ▶\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"/posts/rprj00003\" class=\"text-center bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition\">\n          詳細レビュー\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"my-10 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n    <span class=\"tex